<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαυλῐόδους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όδοντος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, neut. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όδουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					661b23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of animals,
				<i>with outstanding teeth</i> or <i>tusks,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπρος χ.</span> (where most codd.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαυλιόδων,</span>
			
				contr.
			 to the rule of <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				208
			</span></i>, that the correct forms are <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαυλιόδους</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαυλιώδων</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				387
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				663a7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. γένεθλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., of projecting teeth, <i>tusks, tushes,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει [ὁ κροκόδειλος] ὀδόντας μεγάλους
					καὶ χαυλιόδοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.68
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετράπουν χαυλιόδοντας
			φαῖνον,</span> of the hippo-potamus, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.71
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.35
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχαρόδους,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				501a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				661b18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				538b21
			</span></i>.</div>
